{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#card-zh","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Settings 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的子智能体档案管理插件。它在侧边栏提供独立管理面板，并注册模型工具和系统提示区域，让用户维护可复用的智能体角色、适用场景及 provider/model 路由。主要功能包括创建和编辑档案、启用或停用、设置自动启动、按场景委派任务，以及通过模型能力目录选择推理强度和输出上限。档案可由面板或工具读写，并持久保存到本机文件。适合希望把常用子智能体集中管理并按任务调用的 DSH 网页端用户。默认将数据写入 ~/.dsh/agent-settings.json；可用 DSH_HOME 改变默认目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-9","index.js:260-269","index.js:432-505","index.js:512-577","client.js:894-913"]}
{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#card-en","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agent Settings adds a sidebar panel to DSH Web for reusable subagent profiles. Users manage roles, use cases, and model routes, then delegate matching tasks through model tools. Profiles can be enabled, edited, and saved locally; automatic prompt guidance helps select agents by task.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-9","index.js:260-269","index.js:432-505","index.js:512-577","client.js:894-913"]}
