{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#feature-1","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Settings 的功能「管理子智能体档案」：在网页面板创建、编辑、启停和删除档案。点击侧边栏入口后选择列表项或新建，填写职责、适用场景与模型路由并保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:894-913","client.js:691-769","index.js:391-430"]}
{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#feature-2","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Settings 的功能「按任务委派」：模型先调用 list_roster_agents 查看启用的档案，再调用委派工具启动匹配的子智能体。工具将档案角色说明和当前任务提示交给子智能体。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:512-577","index.js:580-635"]}
{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#feature-3","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Settings 的功能「模型路由设置」：档案可指定 provider、model、推理强度与输出上限。保存时验证路由，并读取模型声明的默认能力以补全相应限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:68-80","index.js:356-382","index.js:391-415"]}
{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#feature-4","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Settings 的功能「自动启动建议」：启用自动启动的档案会按 whenToUse 出现在系统提示中。模型据此匹配任务并选择委派工具；用户也可关闭全局或单档案自动启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:286-296","index.js:724-737"]}
{"unit_id":"SwordX-Lu__dsh-agent-settings#feature-5","repo":"SwordX-Lu/dsh-agent-settings","commit":"4a5106f984ac616614637ae7a4155d5036a39bec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agent Settings 的功能「持久保存档案」：面板和模型工具共用同一份档案文件。每次保存会创建目录并写入临时文件，再替换目标文件；启动时也会尝试迁移旧文件名。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-39","index.js:156-165","index.js:244-253"]}
